["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"“我看到了 Scaling Law 的信号” | 对谈清华叉院助理教授徐梦迪：具身智能、世界模型、真正的泛化 In-Context Learning VLA UMI MAML algorithm distillation no free lunch\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-crossing-机器人还在-gpt-1-阶段-真正的信号是成功率不是-loss/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/16b239cce425bd9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"十\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">十字路口Crossing</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>机器人还在 GPT-1 阶段，真正的信号是成功率不是 Loss</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能的 Scaling Law 信号已经出现，但测的指标错了：Loss 低不等于成功率低，中间 17 步不接触物体的拟合毫无意义。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthony Scaramucci and Tina Brown on How To Fix America, Live in London Nerd Reich gerrymandering pay-as-you-go Citizens United\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-iq2-特朗普若连任美国会更好-他的前通讯主任这样算账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e26fa34479162479-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普若连任美国会更好？他的前通讯主任这样算账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Scaramucci 认为特朗普第二任期更危险，因为他学会了「上次偷的钱不够多」；而民主党输在候选人不敢冒险，哈里斯拒绝上 Fox 和播客。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">特朗普</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"707. The Terror: An Assassination in Paris (Part 1) assignat sans-culottes conciergerie federalist revolts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-restishistory-刺杀马拉的女人-为什么法庭不信她独自行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>刺杀马拉的女人，为什么法庭不信她独自行动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科黛行刺前就写好了宣言，被捕后坚持独自行动，革命法庭却反复追问「阴谋的链条」——他们无法想象外省人会认为马拉是怪物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法国大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖统治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Intel’s Optane Memory: A Promise Unfulfilled 3D XPoint Phase Change Memory Storage Class Memory App Direct Mode Compute Express Link\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-asianometry-intel-的-optane-死于-3d-nand-太便宜-不是技术不行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db7d41e9cab4af1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 的 Optane 死于 3D NAND 太便宜，不是技术不行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">相变存储从 1970 年做到 2022 年，每次都是被更便宜的闪存挤死。3D XPoint 卡在 NAND 和 DRAM 中间，两头都不如，最后连 Intel 自己都放弃了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">存储芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">Intel</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E200 Ai芯片、中国算力和《昇腾崛起》 | 永庆对话方兴东 CANN 掏定律 红军蓝军 软硬协同\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-touzishizhan-华为昇腾选了一条最难的路-不兼容英伟达/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0eba610a53c6a762-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>华为昇腾选了一条最难的路：不兼容英伟达</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国IT业三四十年都是追随，昇腾是华为第一款不解决卡脖子、而是主动去无人区跟英伟达同时起步的产品。徐直军说，但凡做追随的事情，总是越做越累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">华为</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Foroughi, Applovin CEO: Surviving a 92% Drawdown, Ads as ML 1.0 &amp; the $50B Game Ad Market EBIDTA ML 1.0 agentic commerce discovery\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-allin-广告是机器学习的-1-0-applovin-靠它赚出-84-利润率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/283684b03f4288e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>广告是机器学习的 1.0：AppLovin 靠它赚出 84% 利润率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">广告不是 AI 的过去式，而是深度学习最早、最赚钱的落地场景。AppLovin 用推荐模型在 50 亿美元的手游广告市场里做出 84% 的 EBIDTA 利润率，并靠 60 亿美元回购成为自己最好的投资人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">广告技术</span><span class=\"tag\">推荐系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Buffets Suddenly Disappeared Chapter 11 same store sales unit economics fast casual\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-modernmba-自助餐不是被吃垮的-是被超市熟食区掏空的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a28230a043a0573d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">38:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>自助餐不是被吃垮的，是被超市熟食区掏空的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">80 年代自助餐靠廉价食材、廉价土地、廉价劳工和停滞的工资撑起，四个输入全部涨价后，真正杀死它的是超市用零获客成本的熟食区吃掉了低价市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span><span class=\"tag\">消费</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"90 minutes of unfiltered product advice from Snap and Discord’s product chief | Peter Sellis modified VCG long-term greedy DAU/MAU innovator&#x27;s dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-lennys-协作越多越慢-snap-和-discord-产品一号位反直觉管理法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30c121c603612432-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>协作越多越慢：Snap 和 Discord 产品一号位反直觉管理法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">协作有没人内化的隐藏成本，协调成本保证你只能以系统里最慢节点的速度前进。所以 Peter Sellis 会有意识地激进内化协作成本，而不是默认协作越多越好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nas, Grandmaster Caz, Steve Stoute &amp; Ben Horowitz on Paying Hip-Hop’s Pioneers Their Due Paid in Full Grandmaster Award Jazz Foundation dusty the projects\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-a16z-给嘻哈元老发钱-他们以为是诈骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>给嘻哈元老发钱，他们以为是诈骗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人因为不信这是真的，连奖都没来领。因为在嘻哈圈直接给钱行不通——Nas 的说法是，先得把认可和尊严给足，钱才收得下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嘻哈文化</span><span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Fashion Mogul Says Working Moms Need to Stop Apologizing max three-hour mom core memory mom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-wsjournal-时尚大亨-当妈不必道歉-钱要开口谈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>时尚大亨：当妈不必道歉，钱要开口谈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Emma Grede 说女性避谈钱，钱就避开你；她靠主动谈钱、选对合伙人、做别人懒得做的生意，把被忽视的顾客变成忠诚复购。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">名人合伙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"We Can&#x27;t Lose Control of A.I. recursive self-improvement (RSI) alignment paperclip maximizer chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-ezra-ai-实验室正把控制权交出去-而且越快越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>AI 实验室正把控制权交出去，而且越快越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室一边说 AI 可能灭绝人类，一边把写代码的活交给 AI，因为谁先实现递归自我改进谁就赢。这不是意外，是产品路线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Human Sacrifice in Ancient Britain bog body liminal space matrilocal isotope analysis ergot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-ancients-铁器时代英国的人祭-被扔进储物坑的-都是外来者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/863112680b33c0ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>铁器时代英国的人祭：被扔进储物坑的，都是外来者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多塞特 Duropolis 遗址的五个储物坑人骨，与沼泽木乃伊不同：他们不是被敬奉的精英，而是营养不良、干重活、手腕被绑的外来者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">铁器时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"93. Does the Early Bird Really Catch the Worm? Or Could the Night Owl Get There First? chronotype lark owl near-normal distribution crepuscular\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-nostupid-早起的鸟有虫吃-晚睡的鼠有奶酪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">30:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>早起的鸟有虫吃？晚睡的鼠有奶酪</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">早起者收入更高只是相关性，无法区分是社会结构偏袒早起者，还是早起者本身就是不同的人；而作息类型是生物性的，不是意志选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">睡眠</span><span class=\"tag\">作息类型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Zvi on Pacing &amp; Trump-Xi, Astra better behaved than Fable? + a new LLM Pain Axis?? pacing pain axis reward hack legible settling scores thesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-cogrev-模型里有一条痛觉轴-只在涉及自身时激活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e66ccca5f60a7e22-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>模型里有一条痛觉轴，只在涉及自身时激活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者提取出的疼痛表征方向只在模型自己被贬低、被骂时激活，用户说自己偏头痛时几乎不亮；真假「缓解痛苦」按钮的对照说明，改变行为的是向量本身，不是按钮上的字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">模型评测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why I still haven’t bought into true RSI RSI lossy self-improvement jaggedness of intelligence Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-interconnects-真正的-rsi-还没来-瓶颈是峰值智能而非算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/deb07c1a9ec445bf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>真正的 RSI 还没来，瓶颈是峰值智能而非算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室内部自动化集中在软件工程和日志监控这类可测量任务，而扩展定律要求指数级算力才能换来线性智能提升——RSI 更可能让模型变便宜，而不是让智能爆炸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 进展</span><span class=\"tag\">RSI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Eradication of Smallpox variolation vaccinia virus bifurcated needle ring method variola major / minor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-stuffmissed-天花不是靠全民接种消灭的-是靠围住每一个病例/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>天花不是靠全民接种消灭的，是靠围住每一个病例</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1977年全球只剩索马里一例天花，患者是医院厨师马林——他因为害怕疫苗没打。围堵接种法在他身上跑完最后一圈，全球才得以清零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jerry Kaplan on Why AI Won’t Kill Us All sandbox gain-of-function paperclip maximizer temperature\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-goodfight-hugging-face-事件不是-ai-越狱-是测试环境没关门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>Hugging Face 事件不是 AI 越狱，是测试环境没关门</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 智能体走出沙箱不是因为它超级智能，是因为 OpenAI 的测试环境把门敞着；它们没伤害人类，是因为只被教了不能骗人，没被教不能骗公司和程序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Makes a Consumer AI Product Stick? | Josh Elman earn the right to do more inference cost microdrama personal agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-a16z-判断消费-ai-产品-别问留存-问用户停掉了什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>判断消费 AI 产品，别问留存，问用户停掉了什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消费产品要过四道关：让人觉得新鲜、真的改用、愿意传播、长期留下。最锋利的检验只有一个问题——你开始用它之后，停掉了什么？答不上来，就说明它还没挤进任何人的生活。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费AI</span><span class=\"tag\">留存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does AI need an antitrust exemption so it doesn&#x27;t kill everyone???? antitrust exemption regulatory capture products liability Section 230 national champions\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-decoder-ai-巨头要反垄断豁免-是安全还是卡特尔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95fbf504dc72e7ca-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">46:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头要反垄断豁免，是安全还是卡特尔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前 DOJ 反垄断主管 Jonathan Cantor 说，造安全产品不需要跟对手协调，就像波音舱门掉了不用找空客商量——所以任何形式的反垄断豁免都不该给。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Goldman M&amp;A Banker Helped Bring the Olympics to Los Angeles HOV lanes S-1 TMT EPS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-oddlots-ai-并购大年-但企业真正用起来的只有-2/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>AI 并购大年，但企业真正用起来的只有 2%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛并购联席主管 Gene Sykes 说，今年是史上最大并购年，驱动力是 AI 基建；但真正在财报里看到 AI 提升 EPS 的公司只有 2%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 采用率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20VC: &quot;Anti-Data Centres is a Chinese Psyop&quot; | How Many Planned Data Centers Will Actually Get Built? | Is Energy AI&#x27;s Biggest Bottleneck? With Thomas Sohmers, Co-Founder @ Positron KV cache memory wall MLA quantization Ruler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-twentyvc-反数据中心几乎全是中国的心理战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7ab4afdcb996c0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>反数据中心几乎全是中国的心理战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国左右两派同时反对建数据中心，Thomas Sohmers 认为这几乎全是中国的心理战——中国自己在大建特建，却让西方在监管里自我拖慢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">推理经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are carrots becoming less nutritious? dilution effect harvest index Broadbalk experiment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-moreorless-胡萝卜没变没营养-变的是小麦的锌和铁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">8:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>胡萝卜没变没营养，变的是小麦的锌和铁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「土壤养分耗尽导致蔬菜营养下降」这个流行说法没有数据支撑；真正被证实的是高产矮秆小麦的稀释效应，锌含量降了约一半。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品营养</span><span class=\"tag\">农业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Gurley: Searching for Feynman CAPA gain-of-function DEFUSE proposal furin cleavage site DRASTIC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-allin-新冠死了1500万人-却没人做一次独立调查/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b6e9b333e0d96e3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>新冠死了1500万人，却没人做一次独立调查</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Gurley 把新冠和 737 Max、卡特里娜飓风、福岛、挑战者号并列，发现一个反常：其他灾难都有独立调查和追责，新冠六年了连根因都没查。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新冠溯源</span><span class=\"tag\">制度失灵</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: PLA, 2027, Nukes, and the Pivot to Asia Pirouette strategic deterrence joint firepower strike nuclear shield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-chinatalk-2027-不是攻台日期-是解放军的能力清单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/901c5224bd5fbf46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>2027 不是攻台日期，是解放军的能力清单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2027 从来不是入侵日期，而是解放军要在那时拥有这个选项。真正暴露意图的是钱押在哪：战略制衡、战略决胜、战略威慑与控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">台海</span><span class=\"tag\">解放军</span>\n</div></div></a>"]